    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Thrown lantern placement turns disciplined foes around, Dusk freezes P2 spotlights, and Shutter Hood cloaks unarmed Wick in stealth.",
    "decisions": 6,
    "expert_s": 85,
    "reward": "item_shutter_hood+manor_parlor_key",
    "why": "Centerpiece mini-boss guarding the Manor's dungeon power and Cycle #2 dumbwaiter shortcut back to Foyer.",
